  "description": "Melodica at full brightness — the plastic keyboard wind instrument sounding its clearest. High filter cutoff, low buzz, minimal pressure variation. Zero competition. The instrument children are given before they can have a piano. Honest, bright, slightly nasal. The foundation note before harmonics complicate it.",
